---
// LEGACY - Pricing section with three plan cards (Good, Better, Best) and Setup Fee
// This component is NOT used in production. Preserved for future reference.
---

<section id="pricing" class="w-full bg-surface py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-h1 text-slate-dark mb-4">
                Planes claros para escalar tu negocio.
